<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Response Required: Insperity Past Due Invoice(s)" recipientType="User" relatedToType="Case">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<p>This is to notify you Case {!relatedTo.CaseNumber} related to the past due status of {!relatedTo.Account.Name}. The account is 135 days past due and remains unresolved.</p>
<p>The following actions are necessary:</p>
<ul>
<li>Notify the service team the client’s service needs to be suspended/deactivated due to failure to pay.</li>
<li>Notify your supervisor to determine next steps in the collection efforts.</li>
</ul>
<br/>
<p>Thank you!</p>
<c:NSP_InsperityEmailLogo ></c:NSP_InsperityEmailLogo>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>